Package: linux-image-iceland
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: iceland mainline <iceland@localhost>
Provides: linux-image
Depends: kmod, linux-base (>= 4.5ubuntu1~16.04.1), linux-modules-iceland (= @VERSION@), linux-firmware-iceland (= @VERSION@), initramfs-tools | linux-initramfs-tool
Suggests: linux-headers-iceland
Description: Linux kernel image @KVER@ for OnePlus Pad 4 (SM8850)
 Arm64 kernel Image built from the iceland metarepo (linux iceland-7.3).
 .
 postinst writes the kernel Image and the Ubuntu boot cmdline, each with
 the BootApp 4-byte LE size prefix, to the GPT kernel and bootcfg
 partitions, then regenerates the initramfs through /etc/kernel/postinst.d
 (initramfs-tools rebuilds it, zz-iceland-flash-initrd flashes the GPT
 initrd partition).
